 R←Test_Misc_001(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;name;help
⍝ Exercise all help functions of ]GitHub
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 list←GetUserCommands
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢list
 list~←⊂'Version'
 ⍝ Every user command must be public, but `Public` may well hold more than that:
 ⍝ it is the package's API, and not everything in an API is a user command.
 →T.PassesIf∧/list∊##.GitHub.Public

 :For name :In list~⊂'Version'
     help←⎕SE.UCMD'GitHub.',name,' -??'
     →T.PassesIf 0<≢help
 :EndFor

 :For name :In list~⊂'Version'
     help←⎕SE.UCMD'GitHub.',name,' -?'
     →T.PassesIf 0<≢help
 :EndFor

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
